{"4269020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meow Mages", "steam_appid": 4269020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Meow Mages on a quest to save the cat village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famine has struck the village, and the only hope lies deep within the dungeons. You must find the legendary Chalice of the Sacred Fish, a relic said to provide infinite fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269020/extras/9329cb5a3b16956ccc457d95f16a64aa.poster.avif?t=1776579442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269020/extras/9329cb5a3b16956ccc457d95f16a64aa.webm?t=1776579442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269020/extras/9329cb5a3b16956ccc457d95f16a64aa.mp4?t=1776579442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with a vast array of spells! Fire, Ice, Lightning, Necromancy, Bubbles, Magic Swords and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269020/extras/64cd4464535619c1daf20a8d5ec058b6.poster.avif?t=1776579442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269020/extras/64cd4464535619c1daf20a8d5ec058b6.webm?t=1776579442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269020/extras/64cd4464535619c1daf20a8d5ec058b6.mp4?t=1776579442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-crafted dungeon floors filled with secrets and survive with few checkpoints  to secure your progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269020/extras/e25848085db9b5a4e856d3cd3ec792b4.poster.avif?t=1776579442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269020/extras/e25848085db9b5a4e856d3cd3ec792b4.webm?t=1776579442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269020/extras/e25848085db9b5a4e856d3cd3ec792b4.mp4?t=1776579442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with 3 more friends for a seamless journey with shared progress </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-crafted dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons and armor to create unique builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your character and strategically increase your stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and discover hidden paths throughout the floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish, cook and eat to restore your health and mana</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Meow Mages on a quest to save the cat village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famine has struck the village, and the only hope lies deep within the dungeons. You must find the legendary Chalice of th